    "longDescription": "Make Your Keyboard Cute! \n\nPersonalize your keyboard with cute themes, stylish fonts, fun sounds, and colorful backgrounds. Create a keyboard that matches your mood and unique style.\n Customize Your Keyboard\n\n- Cute Keyboard Themes – Choose from colorful and adorable keyboard designs.\n- Custom Backgrounds – Give your keyboard a fresh new look.\n- Stylish Fonts – Type with fun and unique font styles.\n- Fun Keyboard Sounds – Add playful sounds to your typing experience.\n- Cute & Aesthetic Styles – Discover charming designs for every mood.\n- Easy Keyboard Setup – Follow simple steps to enable and set Keyora as your default keyboard.\n\nCreate your own style and make every tap more fun with Keyora! ",
